      "content": "but \"starting from nothing\" sounds like a fantasy. what if there is no \"nothing\" to start from? i feel like i'm just stuck in this loop of suffering, and there isn't any version of me that actually works. it feels more like some things are just meant to stay broken. like, why keep fighting to fix something that's clearly beyond repair?",
